{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27860","headline":"宿陈处士书斋 · 朱庆余","name":"宿陈处士书斋","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"结茅当此地，下马见高情。\n菰叶寒塘晚，杉阴白石明。\n向炉新茗色，隔雪远钟声。\n闲得相逢少，吟多寐不成。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"朱庆余","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27860.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27860","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}